# Engineering standards

- Follow `AEI/CHARTER.md` (evidence, independent verification, model independence).
- Zero-tolerance: successful load + WebGPU shader/pipeline success when product code changes.
- `node source/build.mjs` and `node source/wgsl-gate.mjs` as required by `DEVELOPMENT_STANDARDS.md`.
- No invented gate passes; do not weaken tests or edit protected baselines to force a pass.
- Isolated branches + PR prep OK; production deploy requires founder approval.
- Company OS tooling must remain independent of the graphics app loading.
